    "CoiStatement": "Disclosure This study was funded by Innovative Med Concepts, LLC (IMC). William L Pridgen is the founder and CEO of IMC and is a shareholder in IMC. Carol Duffy received research support from IMC in the form of a Sponsored Research Agreement between the University of Alabama and IMC. Judy F Gendreau and R Michael Gendreau are paid consultants for IMC. The authors would like to disclose that this research was presented at the American College of Rheumatology 78th Annual Meeting/Association of Rheumatology Health Professionals 49th Annual Meeting November 14\u201319, 2014 Boston, MA. The authors report no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
